#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3389
msgid ""
"Reload the currently displayed document"
"<p>This may, for example, be needed to refresh webpages that have been "
"modified since they were loaded, in order to make the changes visible."
msgstr ""
"Dat aktuelle Dokment noch eenmol laden "
"<p>Mit to gifft dat Sieden, de ännert warrn. Man de Webkieker wiest noch "
"een olle Siet. Denn kannst Du de Siet nochmol laden."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3392
msgid "Reload the currently displayed document"
msgstr "Dat aktuelle Dokment nochmol laden"

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3394
msgid ""
"Stop loading the document"
"<p>All network transfers will be stopped and Konqueror will display the "
"content that has been received so far."
msgstr ""
"Nich mehr wiederladen"
"<p>Dat wiest blots dat, wat bet nu anlangt is. Dat laden is nu anhollen."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3397
msgid "Stop loading the document"
msgstr "Nich mehr wiederladen"

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3399
msgid ""
"Cut the currently selected text or item(s) and move it to the system "
"clipboard"
"<p> This makes it available to the <b>Paste</b> command in Konqueror and "
"other KDE applications."
msgstr ""
"Dat, wat Du utsökt hest, utknippen un na de Systeem Twüschenaflaag "
"verschuven"
"<p> Denn köönt Konqueror oder annere KDE Programmen dat mit "
"<b>Infögen</b> na düssen Programmen verschuven."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3403
msgid "Move the selected text or item(s) to the clipboard"
msgstr ""
"Den utsökten Text oder de utsökten Indrägen na de Twüschenaflaag "
"verschuven"

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3405
msgid ""
"Copy the currently selected text or item(s) to the system clipboard"
"<p>This makes it available to the <b>Paste</b> command in Konqueror and "
"other KDE applications."
msgstr ""
"Den utsökten Text oder Indrägen na de Twüschenaflaag kopeern "
"<p>Wenn Du dat doen hest, kannst Du düsse Saken mit <b>Infögen</b> in "
"Konqueror oder annere Programmen infögen."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3409
msgid "Copy the selected text or item(s) to the clipboard"
msgstr "Den utsökten Text oder Indrägen na de Twüschenaflaag kopeern"

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3411
msgid ""
"Paste the previously cut or copied clipboard contents"
"<p>This also works for text copied or cut from other KDE applications."
msgstr ""
"De jüste knippt oder kopeert Twüschenaflaag-Saken infögen"
"<p>Dat geiht ok mit Saken, de in annere KDE Programmen kopeert oder knippt "
"sünd."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3414
msgid "Paste the clipboard contents"
msgstr "De Saken vun de Twüschenaflaag infögen"

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3416
msgid ""
"Print the currently displayed document"
"<p>You will be presented with a dialog where you can set various options, "
"such as the number of copies to print and which printer to use."
"<p>"
"This dialog also provides access to special KDE printing services such as "
"creating a PDF file from the current document."
msgstr ""
"Dat aktuell utwiest Dokment drucken"
"<p>"
"Achterna kannst Du in een niegen Dialoog veele Optschonen instellen, to'n "
"Bispeel de, wo often Du dat Dokment drucken wüllst oder op welken Drucker "
"dat druckt warrn schall."
"<p>In düssen Dialoog köönt ok besünnere KDE Druck Dienste instellt "
"warrn. As Bispeel dat maken vun'n PDF-Datei."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3422
msgid "Print the current document"
msgstr "Dat aktuelle Dokment drucken"

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3428
msgid "If present, open index.html when entering a folder."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat een Datei mit Naam index.html in de aktuellen Orner gifft, de Datei "
"apen maken."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3429
msgid ""
"A locked view can't change folders. Use in combination with 'link view' to "
"explore many files from one folder"
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Ansicht froren is, kannst Du de Orner nich wesseln. Dat kannst Du "
"tosammen mit Link Ansicht bruken. Du kannst veele Dateien ut een Orner "
"ankieken"

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3430
msgid ""
"Sets the view as 'linked'. A linked view follows folder changes made in "
"other linked views."
msgstr ""
"De Ansicht as 'verbunnen' instellen. Een verbunnen Ansicht folgt "
"Ornerwessels de in annere linkt Ansichten daan warrt."

